  "additional_source_basis": [
    "Historical initial review at 9dc937f, preserved in content/openhalo/mysql57-compatibility-review.md",
    "Protocol, authentication, and prepared-statement implementation (src/mysql_proto.c, src/mys_auth.c, src/mys_stmt.c): port 3306 supports scram-sha-256/md5/password/trust/reject HBA rules (1045 on others), mysql_clear_password switches via AuthSwitchRequest (0xfe), COM_STMT_FETCH returns 1421, and session max_prepared_stmt_count is 16,382 (1461)",
    "Transaction, DML, and system-variable implementation (src/backend/executor/nodeModifyTable.c, src/mysm/systemVar.c, src/mysm/sysvar_core.c, src/parser/mys_scan.l, src/parser/mys_gram.y): START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT warns 138 outside REPEATABLE READ; REPLACE counts 1 on single-unique-key triggerless identical rows and 1 + deleted_rows when physically deleting/reinserting; non-default auto_increment_increment/auto_increment_offset, wait_timeout/interactive_timeout, and ANSI_QUOTES/PIPES_AS_CONCAT/REAL_AS_FLOAT/IGNORE_SPACE/NO_UNSIGNED_SUBTRACTION/HIGH_NOT_PRECEDENCE are echoed without runtime enforcement",
    "Aggregate and type-mapping verification in contrib/aux_mysql/sql/aux_mysql.sql, contrib/aux_mysql/sql/aux_mysql_fix_compat.sql, and src/parser/mys_gram.y: mysql.sum(bool) returns bigint while AVG/MIN/MAX/STD/BIT_* on bool fail with 1305; FIND_IN_SET remains an SQL function; bare TIMESTAMP maps to timestamp without time zone",
    "Raw acceptance probe results in verification.json and evidence/{release,mysql57,independent-comparison,package-state,historical_wrapper}.json: strict negative BIGINT UNSIGNED raises domain check 3819; SET NAMES ... COLLATE emits warning 1105 and falls back to utf8mb4_general_ci whereas direct SET collation_connection echoes verbatim without changing bare literal comparison"
  ]
}
